  "description": "Hye-Jun, a novelist struggling to sell, is disheartened by the poor performance of his published work when he teams up with Ethan, a popular YouTuber known for his promiscuity. Entering the filming set with preconceived notions, Hye-Jun discovers that Ethan, contrary to his reputation, is a genuinely kind person. He's helplessly thrilled by his affectionate behavior... \n\n*\"Don't be nice to me. I'll just get the wrong impression.\"*\n\n(Source: Bomtoon, translated)",
